cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Age in curated circadian transcriptome datasets: coded table, protocol and analysis script"
message: "If you use this dataset or the analysis script, please cite both this archive and the article it supports."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Rei"
    family-names: "SURNAME"            # <- вписать фамилию
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Astana, Kazakhstan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # <- вписать ORCID
abstract: >-
  Manual coding of every entry of CircaKB for where the age of the animals or
  donors is recorded, in what form, and to what moment it refers. Contains the
  coded table of 54 Gene Expression Omnibus series, the coding protocol with its
  dated revision log, and the Python script that regenerates every reported
  value, the table and the figures from the coded table.
keywords:
  - circadian rhythms
  - metadata
  - data reuse
  - Gene Expression Omnibus
  - reporting standards
  - meta-research
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ACCOUNT/circadian-age-audit"   # <- вписать аккаунт
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-08"          # <- поставить дату релиза
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"        # <- concept DOI из Zenodo
